SUMMARY:AI Circle Houston
DTSTAMP:20260821T033713Z
DTSTART:20260821T093000Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.linkedin.com/groups/18970005/ \nAI Circle Houston i
	s a weekly Friday morning gathering for people building\, implementing\, o
	r exploring AI. \nWe bring together builders\, engineers\, product leaders
	\, founders\, operators\, researchers\, students\, and anyone interested i
	n putting AI into practice. Each week includes networking followed by a fo
	cused session on a practical AI topic\, with discussions spanning AI agent
	s\, AI-native products\, models\, development tools\, reliability\, interf
	aces\, computer vision\, and emerging approaches to building with AI. \nTh
	e format is community-driven\, with an emphasis on learning from people ac
	tively working with AI and sharing what is working\, what isn’t\, and what
	 we’re learning along the way.\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/event/ai-circle-
	houston/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/ai-circle-houston/
LOCATION:Ion\, 4201 Main Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
