UID:lnh1_4PCPD8X25HrC6sPN
SUMMARY:The Girl on the Train at Alley Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260821T033713Z
DTSTART:20260822T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Alley Theatre presents The Girl on the Train\, the 2026 product
	ion in Alley’s annual Summer Chills series\, live on stage in Downtown. \n
	The modern psychological thriller\, adapted from the best-selling novel an
	d hit film\, follows Rachel\, a woman struggling with dependency. \nShe mu
	st piece together her fragmented memories to find a girl who’s gone missin
	g. As her night comes back to her\, she considers\, “Who can you trust whe
	n you can’t trust yourself?” \nAdmission\nTickets start at $32. Order tick
	ets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by th
	e event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details
	. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or o
	ffer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calend
	ar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-theatre-33/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in 
	Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-
	theatre-33/
LOCATION:Alley Theatre\, 615 Texas St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
