SUMMARY:National Beyblade League
DTSTAMP:20260821T033714Z
DTSTART:20260830T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🌀 National Beyblade League: Beyblade X CCS Tournament 🌀\nBlader
	s\, it’s time to step into the stadium. \nThe National Beyblade League is 
	teaming up with CCS Houston for a full day dedicated to Beyblade X. Battle
	 through the tournament\, challenge new rivals in free play\, meet fellow 
	bladers\, and spend the day celebrating one of the fastest-growing competi
	tive hobbies. \n  \n📅 Sunday\, August 30 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St 1
	500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n⚡ Event Highlights ⚡
	\n  \n🏆 National Beyblade League x CCS Tournament | 12PM – 5PM\nBring your
	 strongest combos into the stadium and compete in the official National Be
	yblade League x CCS Tournament. \nTournament Features: \n\nThe tournament 
	begins with a 64-player group stage\, where bladers battle to earn a spot 
	in the Top 16. Once the field is set\, the competition shifts to a single-
	elimination bracket\, where every match brings you one step closer to the 
	championship.\nPrize packages for top finishers: More info on prizes comin
	g soon\n\n👉 Sign-ups here: https://nbl.challonge.com/NBLCCS \nThink you’ve
	 built the ultimate combo? It’s time to prove it in the stadium. \n  \n🏟️ B
	eyblade X Free Play Arena\nThe battles don’t stop when the brackets do. Ju
	mp into the Free Play Arena to test new combos\, run casual matches\, prac
	tice launches\, and challenge other bladers outside of tournament rounds. 
	\n  \n🎮 More Than Just Beyblade\nExplore even more collectibles throughout
	 the show floor with CCS vendors featuring trading cards\, anime collectib
	les\, retro games\, toys\, figures\, and more. \nThe stadium is ready. The
	 brackets are set. The only thing missing is your launch. Join the Nationa
	l Beyblade League: Beyblade X CCS Tournament and see what your combo can d
	o. 🌀 LET IT RIP! 🌀\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/national-beyblade-lea
	gue/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/national-beyblade-league/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT7H
END:VEVENT
