SUMMARY:Nerd Yard Sale IV
DTSTAMP:20260821T033714Z
DTSTART:20260926T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:CCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV — Find Your Next Favorite Thing\n
	Your shelves are full. Your closet has boxes. Your collection has stories.
	 Now it’s time to pass them on. \nCCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV brings fan
	s\, collectors\, and hobbyists together for a weekend of digging through c
	ollections\, finding unexpected treasures\, and giving beloved items a new
	 home. \n  \n📅 September 26-27 | 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 15
	00\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\
	n🧺 Sell From Your Collection\nGot boxes of collectibles collecting dust? D
	ownsizing your shelf? Ready to make room for something new? Set up a table
	 and turn your extras\, duplicates\, and forgotten favorites into someone 
	else’s next great find. Perfect for collectors\, families\, hobbyists\, an
	d anyone ready to clear some space while connecting with fellow fans. \n👉 
	Vendor Tables are open: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHouston \n  
	\n🔎 Dig Through Thousands of Fan Finds\nThe best finds are usually the one
	s you weren’t expecting. Explore tables filled with collections from every
	 corner of fandom\, including: \n📚 Comics\, manga & books\n🎮 Retro games &
	 consoles\n🧸 Plushies\, toys & collectibles\n✨ Anime figures & fandom merc
	handise\n📼 Vintage media & nostalgia finds\n👕 Clothing\, accessories & mem
	orabilia \n  \n🤝 A Community Sale Built By Fans\nNerd Yard Sale is about m
	ore than buying and selling. It’s about talking collections\, sharing memo
	ries\, and meeting people who love the same things you do. \n  \n🏨 Traveli
	ng to Houston?\nMake it a full weekend! Stay close to the event with our s
	pecial hotel rate for Nerd Yard Sale IV attendees. 👉 Book here \n  \nBring
	 your bags\, bring your curiosity\, and get ready to discover the next fav
	orite piece in your collection at CCS Houston Nerd Yard Sale IV.\n\nhttps:
	//ccs-houston.com/events/nerd-yard-sale-iv/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/nerd-yard-sale-iv/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
